							"markdown": "## Decimal places of sliders\n\n`settings.decimalplaces` reduces the number of decimal places of a Float parameter's slider and number input. A value which does not reduce them is ignored.\n\n- **Board Height (model)**: no setting.\n- **Board Height (0 decimal places)**: a parameter of the accordion with `overrides.settings.decimalplaces: 0`.\n- **Board Height (1 decimal place)**: a parameter control with `overrides.settings.decimalplaces: 1`.\n\nAll three show the same parameter."
